        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Devour"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Tail ends, blood gushes from the wound in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in the area takes 5d6 acid damage (41 basic Reflex save). A creature that takes any damage is exposed to the ouroboros's regenerative blood (see below)\n\nWhere the blood falls upon ground, it coagulates into magical snakes that bite at anyone who passes. This is hazardous terrain deals 17 piercing damage and 5 poison damage to any non-ouroboros creature that moves through the square or ends its turn there. A creature that avoids all the piercing damage doesn't take the poison damage.\n\nAfter 1 hour, a blood patch permanently becomes a living snake, typically an emperor cobra (Bestiary 2 245)."
            },
            "id": "01c54874-64c3-4223-b76a-37fbafca9fa9",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:01.886886"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Regenerative Blood"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Regenerative Blood**\nDC: 42\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 24 hours\n- Stage 1: regeneration 5 , slowed 1, and clumsy 2 (deactivated by fire)\n- Stage 2: regeneration 5 , slowed 2 and clumsy 4 (deactivated by fire)\n- Stage 3: The creature's body transmutes into a mass of writhing snakes, with the effects an 8th-level animal form spell but with an unlimited duration."
            },
            "id": "c7cd0a91-ebab-4071-a174-8bbf9546bd99",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:01.886886"
            }
          }
        }
