              "value": "Flying Wheel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The ouroboros is eating its own tail (see Devour Tail)\n\nAs Trample, except the ouroboros can Fly up to double its Speed instead of Striding. Huge or smaller, body, 45."
